  "From rehearsing together\nto practising on your own.": "從一起排練，\n到一個人的練習。",
  "Start designing the tool from problems encountered in making music.": "把音樂活動中的問題帶進工具設計。",
  "Remote ensembles: clocks and latency.": "異地合奏：時鐘與延遲。",
  "Learning piano: notation and sound.": "鋼琴學習：譜面與聲音。",
  "Next, test the prototype through research into teaching.": "下一步：讓原型接受教學研究的檢驗。",
  "First read the score correctly.\nThen we can work on the music.": "譜子讀對了，\n才談得上往下練。",
  "Compare the original with the digital score.": "請把原稿與電子譜放在一起看。",
  "Keep the original so teachers and students can check it.": "保留原稿，方便教師和學生覈對。",
  "Check the time signature, both hands and note lengths.": "拍號、左右手和時值，要逐一檢查。",
  "Recognition is complete; now the checking begins.": "識別完成，是覈對的開始。",
  "Listen to the rhythm first,\nthen the phrasing.": "先聽節奏，\n再聽樂句。",
  "Expressive playing needs a steady rhythmic foundation.": "自然的表情，要有穩定的時間作支撐。",
  "Does the sound match the score?": "譜面與聲音是否對應？",
  "Does the left hand support the melody?": "左手是否托住旋律？",
  "How does one phrase lead into the next?": "一句結束後，下一句怎樣接上？",
  "Can the student still play it\nwhen the prompts are gone?": "關掉提示以後，\n還會彈對嗎？",
  "Feedback has appeared, but learning may not have happened yet.": "反饋出現了，學習未必已經發生。",
  "Give feedback during practice.": "練習時實時提示。",
  "Give feedback after a phrase.": "一個樂句結束後再反饋。",
  "Remove the prompts and observe independent playing.": "關閉提示，觀察獨立演奏。",
  "Does adding another part\nmake the music better?": "多一個聲部，\n音樂就會更好嗎？",
  "Listen to the ensemble, and inspect each part.": "合起來聽，也要分開看。",
  "Is the melody being obscured?": "旋律有沒有被遮住？",
  "Do the parts work together?": "聲部之間有沒有配合？",
  "Can the student actually play it?": "學生是否能夠實際演奏？",
  "Qiuming, please open a piece.\nLet us take a look together.": "請秋鳴打開一首作品，\n我們一起看。",
  "Please pause whenever you wish to explore something.": "可以隨時停下來，留在您關心的地方。",
  "Start with a familiar piece.": "從一首熟悉的作品開始。",
  "Listen to a passage while following the score.": "對照譜面，試聽一個片段。",
  "Take the specific questions into the next stage of research.": "把具體問題留給後續研究。",
  "Tutor photo upload": "導師照片上傳",
  "Soochow University / Tang Qiuming": "蘇州大學 / 唐秋鳴",
