  "Select clear original images from five angles respectively. Natural light, no obstruction, try to keep the same shooting distance. Photos are only saved in the private material space on the server.": "分別選擇五個角度的清晰原圖。自然光線、無遮擋，儘量保持相同拍攝距離。照片僅保存在服務端的私人素材空間。",
  "Not uploaded yet": "尚未上傳",
  "Select photo": "選擇照片",
  "JPG, PNG, WebP, maximum 20MB each": "JPG、PNG、WebP，每張最大 20MB",
  "Left 45°": "左側 45°",
  "Right 45°": "右側 45°",
